                       "\u003cstrong\u003eSmoked sausage plus Cajun seasoning replaces andouille.\u003c/strong\u003e Real andouille carries a specialty price. Kielbasa style smoked sausage with a good Cajun blend gets you the same smoky heat for much less.",
